Hello,

The 0.0.3 version of libtirpc has just been release.
The release contains:

* Client and server APIs were added to match FreeBSD and Solaris APIs
* Symbol Versioning  
* The DES authentication off by default
* A large number patches pull in from the SUSE distro
* The usual bug fixes. 

Thank you... very much for all the help!!!

